{"seq":1,"slug":"server-architecture","title":"服务器架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/production-ready/server-architecture","wordCount":1922,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"服务器架构\">服务器架构</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>将协作原型推向生产环境时，服务器架构决定了系统的可靠性、可扩展性、成本和延迟。常见模式包括：单节点有状态 WebSocket 服务器（适合小规模）、水平集群 + Redis 消息代理（中等规模）、边缘有状态的持久化对象(Durable Objects)（现代方案）、无服务器（受限场景）以及平台即服务(PaaS)。持久化方面通常选择数据库或对象存储（存储 Y.Doc 二进制数据）。认证通过信令端点下发令牌实现。监控关注连接数、延迟和错误率。本节详细介绍服务器架构模式、持久化策略、扩容决策和运维注意事项。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>规模</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单节点有状态</td>\n<td>10万连接</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集群 + Redis</td>\n<td>100万-1000万</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>边缘有状态</td>\n<td>全球</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中（按消息计费）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无服务器</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>不确定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台即服务</td>\n<td>任意</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>高（按消息计费）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"单节点有状态服务器\">单节点有状态服务器</h2><p><strong>架构特点</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>单个 Node.js / Go / Rust 进程承载所有连接。</li>\n<li>所有 WebSocket 连接由同一进程管理。</li>\n<li>文档状态保存在内存或数据库中。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>适用场景</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>并发连接数小于 10 万。</li>\n<li>月活用户小于 100 万。</li>\n<li>小团队或初创公司。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>优势</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>部署极其简单。</li>\n<li>无需处理分布式系统的复杂性。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>劣势</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>存在单点故障风险。</li>\n<li>存在扩展上限。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>技术栈</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Node.js + ws + Yjs。</li>\n<li>通过回调方式持久化到数据库。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"import { WebSocketServer } from &#39;ws&#39;;&#10;import * as Y from &#39;yjs&#39;;&#10;&#10;const wss = new WebSocketServer({ port: 1234 });&#10;const docs = new Map();  // roomId → Y.Doc&#10;&#10;wss.on(&#39;connection&#39;, (ws, req) =&gt; {&#10;  const roomId = getRoomId(req);&#10;  let doc = docs.get(roomId);&#10;  if (!doc) {&#10;    doc = await loadDocFromDB(roomId);&#10;    docs.set(roomId, doc);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  // 接收并应用客户端发来的更新&#10;  ws.on(&#39;message&#39;, (data) =&gt; {&#10;    Y.applyUpdate(doc, new Uint8Array(data));&#10;    // 广播给房间内其他客户端&#10;    broadcastToRoom(roomId, data, ws);&#10;    // 持久化到数据库&#10;    saveDocToDB(roomId, doc);&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  // 发送初始状态&#10;  const state = Y.encodeStateAsUpdate(doc);&#10;  ws.send(state);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { WebSocketServer } from 'ws';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import * as Y from 'yjs';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const wss = new WebSocketServer({ port: 1234 });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const docs = new Map();  // roomId → Y.Doc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>wss.on('connection', (ws, req) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const roomId = getRoomId(req);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let doc = docs.get(roomId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (!doc) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    doc = await loadDocFromDB(roomId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    docs.set(roomId, doc);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 接收并应用客户端发来的更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ws.on('message', (data) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Y.applyUpdate(doc, new Uint8Array(data));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 广播给房间内其他客户端</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    broadcastToRoom(roomId, data, ws);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 持久化到数据库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    saveDocToDB(roomId, doc);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 发送初始状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const state = Y.encodeStateAsUpdate(doc);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ws.send(state);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"水平集群\">水平集群</h2><p><strong>多服务器 + Redis 消息代理架构</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[客户端] --&gt; B[负载均衡器]&#10;    B --&gt; C[WS 服务器 1]&#10;    B --&gt; D[WS 服务器 2]&#10;    B --&gt; E[WS 服务器 3]&#10;    C &lt;--&gt; F[Redis 发布/订阅]&#10;    D &lt;--&gt; F&#10;    E &lt;--&gt; F&#10;    C --&gt; G[(Postgres / Mongo)]&#10;    D --&gt; G&#10;    E --&gt; G\">graph TD\n    A[客户端] --&gt; B[负载均衡器]\n    B --&gt; C[WS 服务器 1]\n    B --&gt; D[WS 服务器 2]\n    B --&gt; E[WS 服务器 3]\n    C &lt;--&gt; F[Redis 发布/订阅]\n    D &lt;--&gt; F\n    E &lt;--&gt; F\n    C --&gt; G[(Postgres / Mongo)]\n    D --&gt; G\n    E --&gt; G</pre><p><strong>每台服务器订阅 Redis 对应房间的频道</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>收到消息后的处理流程</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在本地应用更新。</li>\n<li>发布到 Redis。</li>\n<li>其他服务器收到消息后，转发给本机上该房间的所有客户端。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>会话粘滞(Sticky Session)</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>负载均衡器将同一用户路由到同一台服务器。</li>\n<li>通常基于 Cookie 实现。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"边缘有状态\">边缘有状态</h2><p><strong>Cloudflare 持久化对象(Durable Objects)</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每个房间在全球拥有唯一的单实例。</li>\n<li>实例自动迁移到离用户最近的数据中心。</li>\n<li>提供强一致性保证。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>架构实现</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"export class RoomDurableObject {&#10;  constructor(state, env) {&#10;    this.state = state;&#10;    this.sessions = [];&#10;    this.doc = new Y.Doc();&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  async fetch(request) {&#10;    const url = new URL(request.url);&#10;&#10;    if (url.pathname === &#39;/connect&#39;) {&#10;      const [client, server] = Object.values(new WebSocketPair());&#10;      this.handleSession(server);&#10;      return new Response(null, { status: 101, webSocket: client });&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  handleSession(ws) {&#10;    ws.accept();&#10;    this.sessions.push(ws);&#10;&#10;    ws.addEventListener(&#39;message&#39;, (event) =&gt; {&#10;      Y.applyUpdate(this.doc, new Uint8Array(event.data));&#10;      // 广播给该持久化对象中的所有会话&#10;      this.sessions.forEach((s) =&gt; s !== ws &amp;&amp; s.send(event.data));&#10;    });&#10;&#10;    ws.addEventListener(&#39;close&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;      this.sessions = this.sessions.filter((s) =&gt; s !== ws);&#10;    });&#10;&#10;    // 发送当前状态&#10;    ws.send(Y.encodeStateAsUpdate(this.doc));&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export class RoomDurableObject {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  constructor(state, env) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    this.state = state;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    this.sessions = [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    this.doc = new Y.Doc();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  async fetch(request) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const url = new URL(request.url);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (url.pathname === '/connect') {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      const [client, server] = Object.values(new WebSocketPair());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      this.handleSession(server);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return new Response(null, { status: 101, webSocket: client });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  handleSession(ws) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ws.accept();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    this.sessions.push(ws);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ws.addEventListener('message', (event) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      Y.applyUpdate(this.doc, new Uint8Array(event.data));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      // 广播给该持久化对象中的所有会话</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      this.sessions.forEach((s) => s !== ws &#x26;&#x26; s.send(event.data));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ws.addEventListener('close', () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      this.sessions = this.sessions.filter((s) => s !== ws);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 发送当前状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ws.send(Y.encodeStateAsUpdate(this.doc));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>自动扩展</strong>——Cloudflare 自动处理实例管理。</p>\n<p><strong>费用</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每百万条 WebSocket 消息 $0.65。</li>\n<li>每百万次持久化对象请求 $0.50。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"持久化\">持久化</h2><p><strong>Y.Doc 二进制存储</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"// 保存&#10;const update = Y.encodeStateAsUpdate(doc);&#10;await db.docs.update({ id }, { state: update });&#10;&#10;// 加载&#10;const update = await db.docs.findById(id).then((d) =&gt; d.state);&#10;const doc = new Y.Doc();&#10;Y.applyUpdate(doc, update);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 保存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const update = Y.encodeStateAsUpdate(doc);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>await db.docs.update({ id }, { state: update });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 加载</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const update = await db.docs.findById(id).then((d) => d.state);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const doc = new Y.Doc();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Y.applyUpdate(doc, update);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>存储方案选择</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Postgres BYTEA 类型。</li>\n<li>MongoDB Binary 类型。</li>\n<li>S3 / R2（适合大文档）。</li>\n<li>IndexedDB（客户端本地存储）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>保存频率策略</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每次更新即保存（适合小文档）。</li>\n<li>防抖保存（适合大文档，间隔 5-30 秒）。</li>\n<li>用户断开连接时保存。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"增量保存\">增量保存</h2><p><strong>避免每次都保存完整文档</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"let pendingUpdates = [];&#10;&#10;doc.on(&#39;update&#39;, (update) =&gt; {&#10;  pendingUpdates.push(update);&#10;  debouncedSave();&#10;});&#10;&#10;const debouncedSave = debounce(async () =&gt; {&#10;  const batch = pendingUpdates;&#10;  pendingUpdates = [];&#10;  await db.docUpdates.insertMany(&#10;    batch.map((u, i) =&gt; ({&#10;      docId,&#10;      update: u,&#10;      ts: Date.now(),&#10;    })),&#10;  );&#10;}, 5000);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let pendingUpdates = [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>doc.on('update', (update) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  pendingUpdates.push(update);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  debouncedSave();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const debouncedSave = debounce(async () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const batch = pendingUpdates;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  pendingUpdates = [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await db.docUpdates.insertMany(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    batch.map((u, i) => ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      docId,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      update: u,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ts: Date.now(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    })),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}, 5000);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>恢复流程</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>加载所有增量更新。</li>\n<li>按时间顺序依次应用。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>压缩合并</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>定期将多个增量更新合并为一个快照。</li>\n<li>减少存储空间和加载时间。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"快照-增量更新\">快照 + 增量更新</h2><p><strong>混合策略</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>定期保存完整快照。</li>\n<li>快照之后的更新以增量方式追加。</li>\n<li>恢复时先加载快照，再重放后续的增量更新。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"async function loadDoc(id) {&#10;  const { snapshot, snapshotTs } = await db.snapshots.findById(id);&#10;  const updates = await db.updates.find({ id, ts: { $gt: snapshotTs } });&#10;&#10;  const doc = new Y.Doc();&#10;  Y.applyUpdate(doc, snapshot);&#10;  for (const update of updates) {&#10;    Y.applyUpdate(doc, update.data);&#10;  }&#10;  return doc;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>async function loadDoc(id) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const { snapshot, snapshotTs } = await db.snapshots.findById(id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const updates = await db.updates.find({ id, ts: { $gt: snapshotTs } });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const doc = new Y.Doc();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Y.applyUpdate(doc, snapshot);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for (const update of updates) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Y.applyUpdate(doc, update.data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return doc;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>快照频率</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每小时一次或达到 N 次更新时触发。</li>\n<li>通过后台定时任务执行。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"认证\">认证</h2><p><strong>基于令牌的认证方案</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"// 客户端&#10;const token = await fetch(&#39;/api/auth-token&#39;).then((r) =&gt; r.text());&#10;const ws = new WebSocket(`wss://server/?token=${token}`);&#10;&#10;// 服务端&#10;wss.on(&#39;connection&#39;, (ws, req) =&gt; {&#10;  const token = parseTokenFromUrl(req.url);&#10;  const userId = verifyJWT(token);&#10;  if (!userId) {&#10;    ws.close(1008, &#39;Unauthorized&#39;);&#10;    return;&#10;  }&#10;  // ...&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 客户端</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const token = await fetch('/api/auth-token').then((r) => r.text());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const ws = new WebSocket(`wss://server/?token=${token}`);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 服务端</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>wss.on('connection', (ws, req) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const token = parseTokenFromUrl(req.url);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const userId = verifyJWT(token);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (!userId) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ws.close(1008, 'Unauthorized');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>短期令牌</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>有效期 5-15 分钟。</li>\n<li>通过 HTTP 端点刷新。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>子协议方式传递令牌</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const ws = new WebSocket(url, [&#39;Bearer.token&#39;]);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const ws = new WebSocket(url, ['Bearer.token']);</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"重连机制\">重连机制</h2><p><strong>客户端自动重连</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"class ReconnectingWS {&#10;  connect() {&#10;    this.ws = new WebSocket(this.url);&#10;    this.ws.addEventListener(&#39;close&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;      const delay = Math.min(1000 * 2 ** this.attempt++, 30000);&#10;      setTimeout(() =&gt; this.connect(), delay);&#10;    });&#10;    this.ws.addEventListener(&#39;open&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;      this.attempt = 0;&#10;    });&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class ReconnectingWS {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  connect() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    this.ws = new WebSocket(this.url);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    this.ws.addEventListener('close', () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      const delay = Math.min(1000 * 2 ** this.attempt++, 30000);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      setTimeout(() => this.connect(), delay);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    this.ws.addEventListener('open', () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      this.attempt = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>状态恢复</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>重连后发送 <code>Y.encodeStateVector</code>，服务器只返回差量数据。</li>\n<li>无需重新传输完整状态。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"心跳检测\">心跳检测</h2><p><strong>检测失效连接</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"setInterval(() =&gt; {&#10;  wss.clients.forEach((ws) =&gt; {&#10;    if (ws.isAlive === false) return ws.terminate();&#10;    ws.isAlive = false;&#10;    ws.ping();&#10;  });&#10;}, 30000);&#10;&#10;wss.on(&#39;connection&#39;, (ws) =&gt; {&#10;  ws.isAlive = true;&#10;  ws.on(&#39;pong&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;    ws.isAlive = true;&#10;  });&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>setInterval(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  wss.clients.forEach((ws) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (ws.isAlive === false) return ws.terminate();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ws.isAlive = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ws.ping();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}, 30000);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>wss.on('connection', (ws) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ws.isAlive = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ws.on('pong', () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ws.isAlive = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"负载测试\">负载测试</h2><p><strong>常用工具</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Artillery。</li>\n<li>k6。</li>\n<li>自定义 WebSocket 负载测试脚本。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>测试场景</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>1 万并发连接。</li>\n<li>每个客户端每秒 100 条消息。</li>\n<li>持续运行 1 小时。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>关注指标</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>延迟 p50 / p99。</li>\n<li>错误率。</li>\n<li>服务器 CPU / 内存使用率。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"监控\">监控</h2><p><strong>核心指标</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>并发连接数。</li>\n<li>消息吞吐率。</li>\n<li>延迟。</li>\n<li>错误率。</li>\n<li>重连率。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>监控工具</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Prometheus + Grafana。</li>\n<li>Datadog。</li>\n<li>New Relic。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>告警规则</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>连接断开数突增。</li>\n<li>延迟 p99 超过 1 秒。</li>\n<li>服务器崩溃。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"扩容检查清单\">扩容检查清单</h2><ul>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 单服务器是否满足需求？（并发 ≤ 10 万）</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 会话粘滞是否配置正确？</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> Redis 消息代理是否就绪？</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 持久化策略是否确定？</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 认证机制是否安全？</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 重连逻辑是否健壮？</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 心跳检测是否配置？</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 监控 + 告警是否就位？</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 负载测试是否通过？</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"成本估算\">成本估算</h2><p><strong>自托管 10 万并发</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>1-2 台服务器。</li>\n<li>每月 $200-500。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>自托管 100 万并发</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>10-20 台服务器。</li>\n<li>Redis 集群。</li>\n<li>每月 $5000-20000。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Cloudflare 持久化对象</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>按消息量计费。</li>\n<li>根据实际流量估算。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Liveblocks 托管服务</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>按月活用户计费。</li>\n<li>每千名月活 $30-200。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"反模式\">反模式</h2><p><strong>1. 集群中未配置会话粘滞</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>连接被随机路由到不同服务器。</li>\n<li>跨服务器消息传递产生额外延迟。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. 未做持久化</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>服务器崩溃时丢失所有数据。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. 未实现重连机制</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>网络波动导致用户永久断线。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4. 单个 Y.Doc 过大</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>导致内存膨胀。</li>\n<li>应按资源粒度拆分文档。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>5. 未做负载测试</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>上线后才发现性能瓶颈。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>6. 未做监控</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>故障发生后无法及时发现。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"实战建议\">实战建议</h2><p><strong>1. 从单服务器起步</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>待实际需要时再进行扩展。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. 使用成熟的库</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>y-websocket-server。</li>\n<li>HocusPocus。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. 持久化 + 快照</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>采用混合存储策略。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4. 全球化场景选择边缘方案</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cloudflare 持久化对象。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>5. 尽早接入监控</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在问题扩大前及时发现。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>6. 测试重连逻辑</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>模拟真实网络中断场景。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>生产环境的协作服务器架构有五种主要模式：单节点有状态服务器（适合 10 万以下并发的简单场景）、集群 + Redis 消息代理（支持百万到千万级别，依赖会话粘滞和跨服务器发布/订阅）、边缘有状态的 Cloudflare 持久化对象（全球低延迟，每个房间单实例，自动迁移到最近的用户）、无服务器（适用场景有限）、平台即服务如 Liveblocks（按消息计费）。</p>\n<p>持久化方面，将 Y.Doc 编码为二进制通过 <code>Y.encodeStateAsUpdate</code> 保存、通过 <code>Y.applyUpdate</code> 加载，存储可选 Postgres BYTEA、MongoDB Binary、S3（大文档）或 IndexedDB（客户端）。保存频率根据文档大小选择即时保存、防抖保存或断连时保存。增量保存通过批量追加更新记录并定期压缩为快照来减少存储和加载时间。混合策略结合定期快照和增量更新，恢复时先加载快照再重放后续更新。</p>\n<p>认证采用基于 JWT 的令牌验证，短期令牌（5-15 分钟）配合 HTTP 端点刷新。重连采用指数退避策略（最大 30 秒），重连后通过状态向量实现差量同步而非全量传输。心跳通过 ping/pong 机制每 30 秒检测一次，清除失效连接。</p>\n<p>负载测试使用 Artillery 或 k6，模拟万级并发和高频消息持续一小时。监控使用 Prometheus + Grafana 或 Datadog，设置连接断开、高延迟和服务器崩溃的告警。成本方面，自托管 10 万并发约每月 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>200</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>500</mn><mtext>，百万并发约每月</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">200-500，百万并发约每月</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">，百万并发约每月</span></span></span></span></span>5000-20000，Cloudflare 按消息计费，Liveblocks 按月活计费约每千人 $30-200。</p>\n<p>一个简单的检验标准：你能否为 10 万并发用户设计一个完整的协作服务器架构，包括持久化、认证、重连、心跳和监控方案？</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"服务器架构","id":"服务器架构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"单节点有状态服务器","id":"单节点有状态服务器"},{"level":2,"text":"水平集群","id":"水平集群"},{"level":2,"text":"边缘有状态","id":"边缘有状态"},{"level":2,"text":"持久化","id":"持久化"},{"level":2,"text":"增量保存","id":"增量保存"},{"level":2,"text":"快照 + 增量更新","id":"快照-增量更新"},{"level":2,"text":"认证","id":"认证"},{"level":2,"text":"重连机制","id":"重连机制"},{"level":2,"text":"心跳检测","id":"心跳检测"},{"level":2,"text":"负载测试","id":"负载测试"},{"level":2,"text":"监控","id":"监控"},{"level":2,"text":"扩容检查清单","id":"扩容检查清单"},{"level":2,"text":"成本估算","id":"成本估算"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式","id":"反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"实战建议","id":"实战建议"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"权限与角色","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/collaborative-ux/permissions-and-roles"},"next":{"title":"Liveblocks 与协作平台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/production-ready/liveblocks-and-platforms"}}